<?php elseif($tab==='backup'): ?><p>Signed operational database backups include CRM, line items, payments, expenses, business profile and settings. API credentials, accounts/passwords, conversations, and server configuration are excluded. Keep your application key separately; this installation needs it to validate backups.</p><form method="post"><?php csrf_field(); ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="backup"><button class="btn primary"><?= icon('database') ?> Create database backup</button></form><h3>Backup history</h3><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>DATE</th><th>SIZE</th><th>INTEGRITY</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach(rows('SELECT * FROM backup_records WHERE business_id=? ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 20',[bid()]) as $b): ?><tr><td><?= e($b['created_at']) ?></td><td><?= number_format($b['bytes']/1024,1) ?> KB</td><td><?= badge('Signed') ?></td><td><a class="btn small" href="download.php?type=backup&id=<?= $b['id'] ?>"><?= icon('download') ?> Download</a></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><h3>Restore from a backup</h3><p class="muted">Restore replaces the operational tables listed above. Owner authentication, integrity checks, a preview, and a recovery backup are required. Accounts and audit history are preserved.</p><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data"><?php csrf_field(); ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="restore_preview"><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>Signed YBT backup (.json, maximum 20 MB)</span><input type="file" name="backup" accept=".json,application/json" required></label><?php field('password',['Current Owner password','password',true]); ?></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn">Validate & preview restore</button></div></form><?php if(isset($_SESSION['restore_preview'])):$p=$_SESSION['restore_preview']; ?><div class="notice info">Verified backup from <?= e($p['created_at']) ?>. The following tables will be replaced.</div><pre class="proposal-payload"><?= e(json_encode($p['counts'],JSON_PRETTY_PRINT)) ?></pre><form method="post" data-confirm="Restore this backup and replace current operational records? A recovery backup will be created first."><?php csrf_field(); ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="restore_confirm"><div class="form-grid"><?php field('confirmation',['Type RESTORE','text',true]);field('password',['Current Owner password','password',true]); ?></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn danger">Confirm restore</button></div></form><?php endif; ?>
<?php elseif($tab==='demo'):$counts=demo_preview(); ?><p>Explore freely, then clear the samples when you’re ready. Only records explicitly marked as demo data will be removed. Real records and the Owner account are preserved.</p><h3>Removal preview</h3><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>RECORD TYPE</th><th>DEMO RECORDS TO REMOVE</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($counts as $table=>$count): ?><tr><td><?= e(ucfirst($table)) ?></td><td><?= $count ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><p class="muted">A recovery backup is created first. Removal is blocked if real records depend on demo customers, products, or invoices. The sample Manager is deactivated. Demo data never automatically returns.</p><form method="post" data-confirm="Remove the previewed demo records? A backup will be created first."><?php csrf_field(); ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="demo_remove"><div class="form-grid"><?php field('confirmation',['Type REMOVE DEMO','text',true]);field('password',['Current Owner password','password',true]); ?></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn danger">Remove demo data</button></div></form><p class="muted">Bulk operational reset and selected-settings reset are not implemented. Use archive and reversal workflows for individual records.</p>
